roberta_dynabench_target    | auto         | facebook/roberta-hate-speech-dynabench-r4-target | roberta    | {0: 'nothate', 1: 'hate'}                      
roberta_twitter_hate_latest | auto         | cardiffnlp/twitter-roberta-base-hate-latest      | roberta    | {0: 'NOT-HATE', 1: 'HATE'}                     
